	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『ドラゴンボールZ』より悟天とトランクスがフュージョンし、超サイヤ人化した「超サイヤ人ゴテンクス」が登場！",
			"• Figure-rise Standardならではの、肉体や服を自然な造形と組み立てで再現。",
			"• 充実のエフェクトパーツで独特な必殺技の再現ができる。",
			"• 表情パーツ２種のほか、かめはめ波（両手）、ピ－ス（左手のみ）、人差し（右手のみ）といったポーズを演出するハンドパーツが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Dragon Ball Z\" comes the fusion of Goten and Trunks, \"Super Saiyan Gotenks\" who has become a Super Saiyan!",
			"• Reproduce the body and clothes with natural shapes and assemblies unique to Figure-rise Standard.",
			"• You can recreate unique special moves with a wide range of effect parts.",
			"• In addition to 2 types of expression parts, hand parts are included to create poses such as Kamehameha (both hands), peace (left hand only), and pointing finger (right hand only)."
		]
	},
